~ crescent_start
Crescent Captain: …
Crescent Captain: So the armor still walks.
Crescent Captain: I wondered how long it would take before it reached the Gate.
Crescent Captain: Or should I say—
Crescent Captain: Commander of the Broken Path.
Crescent Captain: You wore that title once.
Crescent Captain: You left without finishing what you began.
Crescent Captain: And yet… here you are.
Crescent Captain: The monsters obey you now, don’t they?
Crescent Captain: You could end this war.
Crescent Captain: Or rule it.
Crescent Captain: Or abandon it, like before.

Crescent Captain: Choose.

- 🔴 Destroy the Order => crescent_destroy
- 🔵 Take Control => crescent_control
- ⚫ Walk Away => crescent_walk_away


~ crescent_destroy
Player: This ends now.
Crescent Captain: I was afraid you’d say that.
Crescent Captain: Hope is a dangerous thing, Commander.
Crescent Captain: It makes people reckless.

do GameState.request_attack.emit()
do GameState.crescent_captain_attack.emit()

Crescent Captain: [wait=2] If you strike me down—
Crescent Captain: —the chains will shatter.
Crescent Captain: The beasts will run free.
Crescent Captain: And so will the people.

Crescent Captain: [wait=2] Let’s see if the world survives your mercy.

=> END

~ crescent_control
Player: Step aside.
Player: This Order will stand — but not under you.

Crescent Captain: …
Crescent Captain: So the throne finally speaks.
Crescent Captain: You always understood what the world needs.
Crescent Captain: Fear.
Crescent Captain: Structure.
Crescent Captain: Silence.

do GameState.crescent_captain_die.emit()

Crescent Captain: [wait=2] Just remember…
Crescent Captain: Orders don’t corrupt people.
Crescent Captain: They reveal them.

Crescent Captain: The Crescent bows.

=> END


~ crescent_walk_away
Player: I’m done choosing sides.

Crescent Captain: …
Crescent Captain: Then why keep the armor?
Crescent Captain: It only listens to those who intend to rule.

Player: That’s why I’m leaving it.

do GameState.drop_armor.emit()

Crescent Captain: You’d walk away from power?
Crescent Captain: From fear itself?

Player: Yes.

Crescent Captain: …
Crescent Captain: Then go.
Crescent Captain: The world will decide what follows.

=> END
